---
title: "emergencyWithdraw (Legion Sale Contracts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: check caller is Legion operator
    q_check_auth --> q_check_token: authorized
    q_check_auth --> q_revert: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_token --> q_get_balance: token address valid
    q_check_token --> q_revert: revert InvalidToken
    q_get_balance --> q_transfer: balance = token.balanceOf(address(this))
    q_transfer --> [*]: transfer(legionDesignatedAddress, balance), emit EmergencyWithdraw
    q_revert --> [*]: revert with error

    note right of q_transfer
        INV-001: emergency withdrawal sends tokens to designated Legion address only
        INV-002: operator-only access prevents unauthorized extraction
        INV-003: intended for stuck token recovery, not normal operations
    end note
